    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know. it just feels exhausting to keep \"resisting\" something that's literally built into my cells. like, if the biology is already set, isn't all this effort just... unnecessary suffering? like we're just prolonging a conclusion that's already been decided.",
